WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:06.250
In this series, I'm

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:09.208
going to teach you how to master breakfast
for any meal of the day.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.666
Breakfast
for dinner. Dinner for breakfast.

00:00:11.666 --> 00:00:14.332
So you like tilting it so the egg gets
underneath? Yep.

00:00:14.332 --> 00:00:15.957
That little bit of water. How much does that help?

00:00:15.957 --> 00:00:17.540
Wow. Pretty F**ckin good.

00:00:20.206 --> 00:00:21.956
Can I ask what makes this breakfast?

00:00:21.956 --> 00:00:24.372
Breakfast can be anything.
Whatever the hell you want it to be.

00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:25.372
It's breakfast.

00:00:25.705 --> 00:00:28.497
So we're going to do some fun stuff today
with eggs, masa,

00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:29.288
and pancakes.

00:00:32.454 --> 00:00:33.038
Cheers.

00:00:33.038 --> 00:00:34.162
Yes!

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.995
I’m Sohla El-Waylly,
and one thing's for certain.

00:00:38.995 --> 00:00:42.995
There are no rules
when it comes to breakfast.

00:00:43.953 --> 00:00:45.328
Let's get flipping.

00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:47.786
Oh, God. How long did you think about that?

00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:51.243
Not long at all.

